      "side": 1,
      "message": "Nit: The outer switch only has a single case, so seems unnecessary unless you are expecting to add more.\n\nSomething along the lines of:\n```suggestion\n            auto* res \u003d value-\u003eAs\u003cInstructionResult*\u003e();\n            TINT_IR_ASSERT(ir, res);\n            \n            // value was emitted by an instruction\n            auto* inst \u003d res-\u003eInstruction();\n            value \u003d tint::Switch(\n                inst,\n                [\u0026](Load* l) {\n                    ir::InstructionResult* from \u003d\n                        l-\u003eFrom()-\u003eAs\u003ccore::ir::InstructionResult\u003e();\n                    TINT_IR_ASSERT(ir, from);\n\n                    result \u003d from-\u003eInstruction()-\u003eAs\u003ccore::ir::Var\u003e();  // Done\n                    TINT_IR_ASSERT(ir, result);\n\n                    return nullptr;\n                },\n                [\u0026](Var* var) {\n                    result \u003d var;\n                    return nullptr;  // Done\n                },\n                TINT_ICE_ON_NO_MATCH);\n```",
